---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Picture from '../../components/Picture.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Planexus – your laboratory container specialists" description="Get to know Planexus: specialist in modular laboratory construction. Experience, innovation and quality for your laboratory projects." canonical="/en/about" ogImage="/attached_assets/generated_images/high-tech_lab_interior.png">
  <div class="pt-20 min-h-screen bg-white">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://planexus.de/en" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About us", "item": "https://planexus.de/en/about" }
      ]
    })} />
    <section class="relative py-24 bg-slate-900 text-white overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/images/backgrounds/ueber-uns-bg.webp')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-10"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 via-slate-900/95 to-slate-900"></div>
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-heading font-bold mb-6">About Planexus</h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Your partner for <strong class="text-white">mobile laboratories</strong> and modular space solutions. We combine long-standing experience with forward-looking engineering.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
          <div class="space-y-8 text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="text-primary w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/><path d="M12 7v5l4 2"/></svg>
                </div>
                History: laboratory container pioneer
              </h2>
              <p>
                When Sven Biewald presented the first fully functional <strong>laboratory container</strong> with his then company MC Labor at Analytica in Munich in 2016, the industry was sceptical. Many dismissed him — too unconventional, too new, too visionary. He believed in the idea, and he was right.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="text-primary w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"/></svg>
                </div>
                Innovation in modular construction
              </h2>
              <p>
                New standards were set in mobile laboratory construction — modular, flexible and reliable. What was once a niche became a pioneering model for modern laboratory solutions. That experience now flows 100% into Planexus.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 text-white">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="p-2 bg-primary rounded-lg">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="text-white w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"/><path d="M9 18h6"/><path d="M10 22h4"/></svg>
                </div>
                The future: Planexus GmbH
              </h2>
              <p class="text-slate-300">
                In Sven Biewald and Thomas Boss, Planexus unites concentrated expertise. Together we develop <strong>laboratory-container concepts</strong> that not only meet today’s requirements, but actively shape the future of laboratory construction.
              </p>
              <p class="text-slate-300 mt-4">
                Learn more about our <a href="/en/team" class="text-primary hover:underline">expert team</a>, our <a href="/en/services" class="text-primary hover:underline">laboratory-container services</a>, or take a look at our <a href="/en/projects" class="text-primary hover:underline">completed projects</a>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-8">
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl h-[400px] relative">
              <Picture src="/attached_assets/generated_images/high-tech_lab_interior.png" alt="High-tech laboratory interior" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width={1024} height={1024} />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 text-white">
                <p class="font-bold text-lg">State-of-the-art equipment</p>
                <p class="text-sm opacity-80">Functionality meets design</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-slate-900">Why choose Planexus?</h3>
              <ul class="space-y-4">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-lg text-slate-700">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
                  <span>Intelligent modular laboratory concepts</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-lg text-slate-700">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
                  <span>Sustainable and energy-efficient construction</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-lg text-slate-700">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
                  <span>Over 10 years of specialised expertise among our Managing Directors</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-lg text-slate-700">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
                  <span>Tailored laboratory planning</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-lg text-slate-700">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
                  <span>Quality Made in Germany</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <a href="/en/about/awards" class="block bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 to-primary/5 p-6 rounded-xl border-2 border-primary/40 hover:border-primary transition-colors group">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-10 h-10 text-primary shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"/></svg>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold mb-1">German CEO Excellence Awards 2026</p>
                  <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Double recognition from EU Business News</h3>
                  <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Planexus GmbH as <em>Leading Modular Laboratory Containers Provider 2026</em> and Sven Biewald as <em>Most Innovative Laboratory Spaces Leader 2026</em>. <span class="font-semibold text-primary">Find out more →</span>
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>

            <div class="bg-primary/10 p-6 rounded-xl border border-primary/20">
              <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Read in our <a href="/en/magazine" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">magazine</a> how we solve challenges in <a href="/en/services/modular-construction" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">modular construction</a> and <a href="/en/services/planning" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">specialist engineering</a> — or <a href="/en/contact" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">contact us directly</a> for a personal consultation.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
